# Scenario: research office illustrates an interdisciplinary grant opportunity.
venn "Interdisciplinary climate-health research"
set climate "Climate science"
set health "Public health"
set data "Data science"
climate only: "Climate models"
health only: "Community health"
data only: "Machine learning"
climate & health: "Heat exposure"
climate & data: "Downscaling"
health & data: "Surveillance"
climate & health & data: "Early-warning systems"
